<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.lei.lands ~ land ~ the pūlama's signed record lands

`lares lei land '<answer>'` lands a record the hand signed at the pūlama's hand door, where a vessel under a pūlama sends its lei acts: the line names the pūlama's printed answer (its record and face) or a bare record with `--face`. A lei rides the kui row, an unstring the unstring row; the vessel verifies the record and asks no route. An answer for every face lands each face's record by its own face and names where the pūlama's signing stopped (`stopped`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ land

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`land` params=`record/<answer-json> ~ land the pūlama's answer`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ record · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`record` params=`takes/json needs/required seat/1 as/<record> ~ the pūlama's answer, or a bare record`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose line this reads or strings, a whole count from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the hand signed at the pūlama; the vessel verifies the record and asks no route`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ the record reads as no JSON object, names no lei, or its face differs from --face`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ landed · stopped

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[faces stopped]] ~ each record landed`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`stopped` params=`exit/1 ~ the pūlama's signing stopped; the reading names where`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares lei land

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares lei land]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

